## Features Implemented

| Feature | Details |
|---|---|
| **Onboarding** | Name entry on first launch, persisted in AsyncStorage |
| **Dashboard** | Time-based greeting, motivational quote, 3 summary cards with counts |
| **Daily Schedule** | CRUD with time picker, 25-char task name limit, repeating alarm notifications |
| **Reminders** | CRUD with time picker, active/inactive toggle, repeating daily notifications |
| **Timed Tasks** | CRUD with days/months duration picker, deadline countdown with color coding (🟢🟡🔴), completion toggle, Google Calendar-style early reminders (2d, 1d, deadline) |
| **Motivational Messages** | 50+ templates with `{name}/{task}` placeholders, user can choose custom or motivational per task |
| **Notifications** | `expo-notifications` with Android channels (alarm + default), custom alarm sound for daily schedules |
| **Dark Theme** | Deep navy background, glassmorphism cards, purple/teal/coral accents |
| **Offline** | 100% offline — all data in AsyncStorage, no network required |

